#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:69
#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/convert.php:410
msgid "That is not a Breakdance post type on this install."
msgstr "Non è un post type Breakdance in questa installazione."

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:87
msgid "No display conditions were given, so this template will exist but never appear. Assign some, or tell the user it is unassigned."
msgstr "Non sono state fornite condizioni di visualizzazione, quindi questo template esisterà ma non comparirà mai. Assegnane alcune, oppure avvisa l'utente che non è assegnato."

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:110
msgid "Untitled template"
msgstr "Template senza titolo"

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:148
msgid "The template was built but its conditions were not set. Assign them with nibwp/breakdance-conditions."
msgstr "Il template è stato creato ma le sue condizioni non sono state impostate. Assegnale con nibwp/breakdance-conditions."

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:167
msgid "Breakdance Pro — Plan a loop"
msgstr "Breakdance Pro — Pianifica un loop"

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:224
msgid "Give this either a node payload or a post_id."
msgstr "Fornisci un payload di nodi oppure un post_id."

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:238
msgid "Create a post type for these items, or pick an existing one."
msgstr "Crea un post type per questi elementi, oppure scegline uno esistente."

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:239
msgid "Add fields for the parts that differ between the copies — heading, text, image, link."
msgstr "Aggiungi campi per le parti che cambiano tra le copie: intestazione, testo, immagine, link."

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:240
msgid "Replace the repeated nodes with one loop element bound to that post type."
msgstr "Sostituisci i nodi ripetuti con un unico elemento loop collegato a quel post type."

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:241
msgid "Inside the loop, bind each field with dynamic data instead of typed text."
msgstr "All'interno del loop, collega ogni campo con dati dinamici invece che con testo digitato."

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:242
msgid "Move the existing content into items of that post type."
msgstr "Sposta i contenuti esistenti in elementi di quel post type."

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:252
msgid "No repetition worth converting."
msgstr "Nessuna ripetizione che valga la pena convertire."

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:253
msgid "Repetition found. Ask the user whether this content will change or grow — if it will, a loop is worth it."
msgstr "Trovate ripetizioni. Chiedi all'utente se questo contenuto cambierà o crescerà: in tal caso, un loop vale la pena."

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:260
msgid "Breakdance Pro — Design library"
msgstr "Breakdance Pro — Libreria di design"

#: includes/skills/breakdance-pro/abilities/build.php:294
